  "body": "> Hi\n> \n> > For CR3 files straight out of a Canon camera, if in ART I explicitly click on one to open it in the main editing window, then renaming the file in ART or even moving it outside ART is not possible until I close ART.\n> \n> could it be that the file is somehow \"locked\" by windows? E.g. because maybe it's still in use by the app you use for importing? There's no logic in ART that depends on the file type, I suspect this is something happening elsewhere...\n\nIn terms of importing the CR3s onto my machine, I am using the native OS to copy directly from the SD card with no additional software. Likewise, I can still rename CR3s in ART _until_ I happen click to open them.",
